buffAECNewbieProtection,buffs,Buff,,[50DC50]Newbie protection[-]
buffAECNewbieProtectionDesc,buffs,Buff,,You are below Game Stage 100. AEC events will not directly target you or alter nearby spawns for you. Heatmap won't affect your surrounding spawns.
