aecExtremeWorkstation,blocks,Block,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Extreme Workstation
aecExtremeWorkstationDesc,blocks,Block Desc,,A salvaged radio converted into a black market crafting station. Use it to craft exclusive AEC items.
aecHeadConverter,blocks,Block,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Mutation Sample Exchange
aecHeadConverterDesc,blocks,Block Desc,,A legacy AEC workstation repurposed for safe two-way exchange of mutation samples. It provides the same upgrade and downgrade recipes as the main Mutation Exchange.
aecNecroforgeWorkbench,blocks,Block,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Necroforge Workbench
aecNecroforgeWorkbenchDesc,blocks,Block Desc,,Converts standard ammunition and tiered AEC mutation samples into larger ammunition bundles. Higher sample tiers increase quantity only; ammunition stats do not change. Crafted in the Extreme Workstation.
