modAECMutatorEmpty,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] [FFFFFF]EMPTY MUTATOR[-]
modAECMutatorEmptyDesc,,,,Base mutator. Can be used to make custom mutators to increase your skills.
aecExtremeModCraftingTable,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] [FFFFFF]Extreme Mod Crafting Table[-]
aecExtremeModCraftingTableDesc,,,,Dedicated workstation for extreme AEC modifiers.
aecEndgameDiscordNote,,,,discord.gg/CP4HDb3r3j
aecEndgameDiscordNoteDesc,,,,Join the AEC PROJECT Discord for any mod question or request.
aecEOArchiveWorkshopPrecautionTuto,,,,[FF4500]READ BEFORE USING THE ARCHIVE WORKSHOP[-]
aecEOArchiveWorkshopPrecautionProg,,,,[FF4500]READ BEFORE USING THE ARCHIVE WORKSHOP[-]
aecEOArchiveWorkshopPrecautionDesc,,,,"WARNING: reading a Tutorial or Progression book whose level is LOWER than your current unlock level will roll your archive progression back to that book's level, and every higher-level unlock gained since will be lost. Always check a book's number before reading it. As a safety net, craft and keep a duplicate of this note (and of your highest books) so you always have a backup reminder in case of a mistake."
