modAECMutatorMegaRagdollMelee,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Worldquake Gavel
modAECMutatorMegaRagdollMeleeDesc,,,,Worldquake force on every hit ; rate of fire -55% ; massive ragdoll in area 3.00 for 4.00 ; damage +500% ; dismember chance +0.90. Can be installed on clubs and brawler weapons.
modAECMutatorMegaShockwaveMelee,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Seismic Halo
modAECMutatorMegaShockwaveMeleeDesc,,,,Seismic halo bursts on impact ; rate of fire -50% ; ragdoll in area 2.80 for 3.50 ; damage +450% ; dismember chance +0.75. Can be installed on all weapons and tools.
modAECMutatorMegaDirectRagdollMelee,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Execution Vector
modAECMutatorMegaDirectRagdollMeleeDesc,,,,Execution vector launches the target ; rate of fire -45% ; direct ragdoll for 4.00 ; damage +425% ; dismember chance +0.70. Can be installed on all weapons and tools.
modAECMutatorMegaThorMace,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Stormlord Scepter
modAECMutatorMegaThorMaceDesc,,,,Stormlord charge on every strike ; ragdoll in area 2.40 for 3.00 ; buff Shocked guaranteed 100% in area 2.40 for 6.00 ; damage +400%. Can be installed on clubs and brawler weapons.
modAECMutatorMegaImpactGun,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Tyrant Bore
modAECMutatorMegaImpactGunDesc,,,,Every shot slams enemies to the floor ; buff Injury Knockdown guaranteed 100% in area 3.00 ; damage +400% ; rate of fire +200% ; reload speed +100%. Can be installed on firearms and ranged turrets.
modAECMutatorMegaPinningBow,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Warden String
modAECMutatorMegaPinningBowDesc,,,,A that turns every arrow into a sentence ; knockdown guaranteed 100% in area 3.50 ; damage +350% ; damage bonus +2.00 ; dismember chance +0.75. Can be installed on all archery weapons.
modAECMutatorMegaChaosHybrid,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Pandemonium Matrix
modAECMutatorMegaChaosHybridDesc,,,,Half weapon half and full chaos ; ragdoll in area 2.10 for 2.50 ; entity damage +300% ; block damage +300% ; degradation per use -50%. Can be installed on all weapons and tools.
modAECMutatorMegaDemolisherTool,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Ruin Architect
modAECMutatorMegaDemolisherToolDesc,,,,Turn every work site into wreckage ; block damage +600% ; harvest count +400% ; degradation per use -65% ; entity damage +200%. Can be installed on all tools.
modAECMutatorMegaHunterHybrid,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Apex Covenant
modAECMutatorMegaHunterHybridDesc,,,,Predator style for tracking and finishing ; knockdown 60% in area 3.00 ; damage bonus +2.50 ; entity damage +250% ; dismember chance +0.60. Can be installed on all weapons and archery weapons.
modAECMutatorMegaTitanArmor,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Atlas Carapace
modAECMutatorMegaTitanArmorDesc,,,,A colossus shell that never stops ; health regen +8.00 ; stamina regen +8.00 ; max stamina +60% ; xp gain +150%. Can be installed on all pieces.
modAECMutatorMegaSprintLeg,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Comet Striders
modAECMutatorMegaSprintLegDesc,,,,Rocket legs for dancing around danger ; run speed +200% ; walk speed +150% ; jump strength +150% ; stamina cost -70%. Can be installed on and boots.
modAECMutatorMegaNeuroHead,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Synapse Crown
modAECMutatorMegaNeuroHeadDesc,,,,Your mind goes superhuman ; xp gain +400% then +150% ; entity damage +100%. Can be installed on .
modAECMutatorMegaGravHammer,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Singularity Anvil
modAECMutatorMegaGravHammerDesc,,,,Heavy slow unstoppable ; rate of fire -45% ; giant ragdoll in area 3.20 for 4.50 ; entity damage +450% ; block damage +150%. Can be installed on clubs and brawler weapons.
modAECMutatorMegaValkyrieBlade,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Skyreaver Oath
modAECMutatorMegaValkyrieBladeDesc,,,,A divine blade with no mercy ; buff Shocked 75% in area 2.20 for 4.00 ; entity damage +350% ; damage bonus +2.00 ; dismember chance +0.70. Can be installed on all weapons and tools.
modAECMutatorMegaJudgementGun,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Final Verdict
modAECMutatorMegaJudgementGunDesc,,,,Every bullet is a verdict ; rate of fire -35% ; knockdown guaranteed 100% in area 3.50 ; damage +500% ; reload speed -20%. Can be installed on firearms and ranged turrets.
modAECMutatorMegaFrenzyGun,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Bloodrush Engine
modAECMutatorMegaFrenzyGunDesc,,,,Berserk mode active ; knockdown 35% in area 2.50 ; rate of fire +350% ; reload speed +150% ; damage +200%. Can be installed on firearms and ranged turrets.
modAECMutatorMegaStormBow,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Tempest Choir
modAECMutatorMegaStormBowDesc,,,,A storm tied to a bowstring ; buff Shocked 85% in area 3.00 for 5.00 ; knockdown 45% in area 3.00 ; damage +300% ; dismember chance +0.50. Can be installed on all archery weapons.
modAECMutatorMegaHarpoonBow,,,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Leviathan Hook
modAECMutatorMegaHarpoonBowDesc,,,,The harpoon that drops everything moving ; knockdown guaranteed 100% in area 3.40 ; damage +250% ; damage bonus +3.00 ; dismember chance +0.50. Can be installed on all archery weapons.
