aec_tuto_p4_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[5599FF]AEC Tutorial — 4/10 | Zombie Grades[-]
aec_tuto_p5_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[5599FF]AEC Tutorial — 5/10 | Hazard System[-]
aec_tuto_p6_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[5599FF]AEC Tutorial — 6/10 | Contract Rewards[-]
aec_tuto_p7_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[5599FF]AEC Tutorial — 7/10 | AEC Gear & Drops[-]
aec_tp2_l1_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[FFD700]── UNIVERSAL CONTRACT CURRENCY ──[-]
aec_tp2_l2_text,dialogs,Dialog,,Each completed AEC contract awards [FFCC33]Universal Universal AEC Universal Tokens[-].
aec_tp2_l3_text,dialogs,Dialog,,Higher tiers and larger contracts award more universal Tokens. The universal currency replaces all former tier-specific quest items.
aec_tp3_l1_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[FFD700]── POI SIZES ──[-]
aec_tp3_l2_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[AAAAAA]A1[-] Small | [AAAAAA]A2[-] Medium | [AAAAAA]A3[-] Large | [AAAAAA]A4[-] Huge | [AAAAAA]A5[-] Massive
aec_tp3_l3_text,dialogs,Dialog,,"Larger POIs give more XP, more loot slots and higher token rewards"
aec_tp3_l4_text,dialogs,Dialog,,"[00FF66]Each tier starts with small POIs, then finish to massive POIs[-]"
aec_tp4_l1_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[FFD700]── ZOMBIE GRADES ──[-]
aec_tp4_l2_text,dialogs,Dialog,,11 grades: [00FF66]T05 Veteran[-] → [FFCC33]T10 Nightmare[-] → [FF3333]T15 Mythic[-]
aec_tp4_l3_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[FF3333]T15 Mythic hits ~10x harder than T05. Scale your gear accordingly[-]
aec_tp5_l1_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[FFD700]── HAZARD SYSTEM ──[-]
aec_tp5_l2_text,dialogs,Dialog,,Killing in biomes raises your Hazard level (1 to 5)
aec_tp5_l3_text,dialogs,Dialog,,Higher Hazard = denser packs and higher zombie grades
aec_tp5_l4_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[FF3333]Hazard 5: mass convergence — evacuate or fortify immediately[-]
aec_tp6_l1_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[FFD700]── CONTRACT REWARDS ──[-]
aec_tp6_l2_text,dialogs,Dialog,,"Casino coins: [00FF66]500 (T05)[-] up to [FF4500]7,500 (T15)[-]"
aec_tp6_l3_text,dialogs,Dialog,,"XP: up to [FFCC33]750,000 XP[-] (T15 A5) | 3 loot slots per contract"
aec_tp7_l1_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[FFD700]── AEC GEAR & DROPS ──[-]
aec_tp7_l2_text,dialogs,Dialog,,AEC gear works as [FFCC33]weapon/tool/armor mutators[-]
aec_tp7_l3_text,dialogs,Dialog,,Materials sources: boss and high-tier zombie kills | quests | misc loot
aec_tuto_p8_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[5599FF]AEC Tutorial — 8/10 | Mutation Samples[-]
aec_tuto_p9_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[5599FF]AEC Tutorial — 9/10 | Nemesis System[-]
aec_tuto_p10_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[5599FF]AEC Tutorial — 10/10 | Nemesis — Wars & Migration[-]
aec_th_p8_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[FFD700]── MUTATION SAMPLES AND EXCHANGE ──[-]
aec_tp8_l1_text,dialogs,Dialog,,Use the [FFCC33]Mutation Exchange[-] to upgrade or downgrade tiered [8EBE67]mutation samples[-].
aec_tp8_l2_text,dialogs,Dialog,,Credited AEC kills grant samples automatically; enemy grade determines their tier and amount.
aec_tp8_l3_text,dialogs,Dialog,,"Use [FFD700]universal AEC Tokens[-] and [8EBE67]mutation samples[-] in recipes, upgrades and progression."
aec_tp8_l4_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[00FF66]Five samples upgrade into one of the next tier; one sample downgrades into five of the previous tier.[-]
aec_th_p9_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[FFD700]── NEMESIS SYSTEM ──[-]
aec_tp9_l1_text,dialogs,Dialog,,A pool of [FF3333]named nemesis[-] bosses lives in your world simultaneously
aec_tp9_l2_text,dialogs,Dialog,,6 ranks: [AAAAAA]Lesser[-] | [44BBFF]Greater[-] | [44FF88]Elite[-] | [FFCC33]Champion[-] | [FF8800]Legendary[-] | [FF3333]World[-]
aec_tp9_l3_text,dialogs,Dialog,,"Each nemesis has a [FF8800]territory[-], a [FF3333]name[-] and a [FFCC33]title[-] (e.g. GRIMTOOTH the Butcher)"
aec_tp9_l4_text,dialogs,Dialog,,Kill a nemesis enough times to permanently destroy it — then its slot refills with a new one
aec_th_p10_text,dialogs,Dialog,,[FFD700]── NEMESIS — GRUDGE & WARS ──[-]
aec_tp10_l1_text,dialogs,Dialog,,Kill a nemesis → it holds a [FF3333]grudge[-]: it may hunt you down personally
aec_tp10_l2_text,dialogs,Dialog,,Kill an AEC boss → a related nemesis may swear [FF8800]revenge[-] against you
aec_tp10_l3_text,dialogs,Dialog,,"Periodically: nemesis [FFCC33]hierarchy wars[-] — the loser loses rank, the winner promotes"
aec_tp10_l4_text,dialogs,Dialog,,Nemesis [44BBFF]migrate territories[-] over time — they may show up near your base
aec_tph_text,dialogs,Dialog,,.....................
dialog_trader_response_aec_resetquests,dialogs,Dialog,,[AA88CC]~ Reset quest display / fix bugged quest list ~[-]
