aec_eo_tutorial_intro_01_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 001[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_01_offer,quests,Quest,,Kill 25 vanilla zombies.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_01_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 1: Welcome to AEC ENDGAME OVERHAUL world. Prove that you can survive the first infected. Kill 25 vanilla zombies.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_01_obj_vanilla_zombies,quests,Quest,,Vanilla Zombies
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_02_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 002[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_02_offer,quests,Quest,,Collect 100 Wood and 5 Forged Iron.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_02_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 2: gather the basic materials needed to begin AEC production. Collect 100 Wood and 5 Forged Iron.
aec_eo_tutorial_archive_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 003[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_archive_offer,quests,Quest,,Craft 1 AEC Quest Archive Radio.
aec_eo_tutorial_archive_desc,quests,Quest,,"Chapter 3: craft an AEC Quest Archive Radio. This station lets you recreate any FIELD GUIDE, TUTORIAL, or PROGRESSION book you have already read, up to the latest unlocked chapter. Each archived book costs 10 Paper."
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_03_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 004[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_03_offer,quests,Quest,,Craft 1 AEC mutation samples Converter.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_03_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 4: craft an AEC mutation samples Converter to transform tiered mutation samples and special zombie parts.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_04_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 005[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_04_offer,quests,Quest,,Craft 25 Headless Zombie Parts.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_04_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 5: use the mutation samples Converter to craft 25 Headless Zombie Parts.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_05_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 006[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_05_offer,quests,Quest,,Craft 1 AEC Zombie Market Terminal.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_05_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 6: craft an AEC Zombie Market Terminal to access the expanded market progression.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_06_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 007[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_06_offer,quests,Quest,,Craft 1 main Crypto Miner request.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_06_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 7: craft the main Crypto Miner request at the AEC Zombie Market Terminal.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_07_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 008[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_07_offer,quests,Quest,,Craft 1 Level 0 Battery request.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_07_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 8: craft a Level 0 Battery request for your Crypto Miner.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_08_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 009[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_08_offer,quests,Quest,,Craft 1 Headless 0★ Connection Card.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_08_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 9: craft a Headless 0★ Connection Card to configure Headless coin production.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_09_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 010[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_09_offer,quests,Quest,,Craft 100 Headless 0★ Coins.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_09_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 10: operate the Crypto Miner and craft 100 Headless 0★ Coins by adding Headless 0★ Connection Cards.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_10_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 011[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_10_offer,quests,Quest,,Craft 1 Headless 0★ Research Paper.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_10_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 11: use the Zombie Market to craft 1 Headless 0★ Research Paper.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_11_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 012[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_11_offer,quests,Quest,,Craft 1 Headless 0★ Passive Part Miner request.
aec_eo_tutorial_intro_11_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 12: craft a Headless 0★ Passive Part Miner request to automate zombie-part production.
aec_eo_tutorial_relay_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 013[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_relay_offer,quests,Quest,,Craft 1 AEC Contract Relay to access daily AEC Boss and Minion quests.
aec_eo_tutorial_relay_desc,quests,Quest,,"Chapter 13: craft an AEC Contract Relay. Place and activate it to summon a drone that offers a refreshed daily list of AEC Boss and Minion quests. The drone disappears when its chunk unloads, but the relay can summon it again infinitely."
