aecEOTutorialBook12,items,Item Name,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL[-] | Chapter 024
aecEOTutorialBook12Desc,items,Item Desc,,Open to start Chapter 24 of the AEC EO tutorial chain.
aec_eo_tutorial_01_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 014[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_01_offer,quests,Quest,,Obtain 1 universal AEC Token to validate your first AEC objective. Complete early trader jobs to unlock AEC contracts; completed contracts award universal Tokens.
aec_eo_tutorial_01_desc,quests,Quest,,"Chapter 1: obtain 1 universal AEC Token and initialize the tutorial chain. Complete early trader jobs to unlock AEC contracts. Contracts award universal Tokens, while credited AEC kills grant mutation samples and Infected Teeth."
aec_eo_tutorial_02_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 015[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_02_offer,quests,Quest,,Accumulate 26 universal AEC Tokens after unlocking T05 AEC contracts. Complete all five vanilla trader tiers and check the requirements in the skills tab.
aec_eo_tutorial_02_desc,quests,Quest,,"Chapter 2: accumulate 26 universal AEC Tokens and prepare for the combat chapters. Complete all five vanilla trader tiers, unlock T05 AEC contracts and finish them for Tokens."
aec_eo_tutorial_03_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 016[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_03_offer,quests,Quest,,"Eliminate Dumdum minions and boss, veteran zombies, and executioner minions."
aec_eo_tutorial_03_desc,quests,Quest,,"Chapter 16: complete the mixed combat trial against AEC special targets. Eliminate Dumdum minions and boss, veteran zombies, and executioner minions."
aec_eo_tutorial_04_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 017[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_04_offer,quests,Quest,,Craft 1 AEC Extreme Mod Crafting Table.
aec_eo_tutorial_04_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 17: build your AEC Extreme Mod Crafting Table. Craft 1 AEC Extreme Mod Crafting Table.
aec_eo_tutorial_05_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 018[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_05_offer,quests,Quest,,Craft 1 AEC Empty Mutator.
aec_eo_tutorial_05_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 18: craft an empty mutator to unlock the other mutators. Craft 1 AEC Empty Mutator.
aec_eo_tutorial_06_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 019[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_06_offer,quests,Quest,,Kill 10 headless minions.
aec_eo_tutorial_06_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 19: survive and clear a headless minion wave. Kill 10 headless minions.
aec_eo_tutorial_07_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 020[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_07_offer,quests,Quest,,Craft 1 AEC Mutator Power 01.
aec_eo_tutorial_07_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 20: craft your first power mutator. Craft 1 AEC Mutator Power 01.
aec_eo_tutorial_08_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 021[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_08_offer,quests,Quest,,Kill Tier05 zombies and executioner minions (star 1).
aec_eo_tutorial_08_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 21: complete the second combat checkpoint. Kill T05 zombies and executioner minions (star 1).
aec_eo_tutorial_09_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 022[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_09_offer,quests,Quest,,Craft 1 AEC Mutator Power 02.
aec_eo_tutorial_09_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 22: upgrade your mutator progression to power 02. Craft 1 AEC Mutator Power 02.
aec_eo_tutorial_10_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 023[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_10_offer,quests,Quest,,Kill headless/doomlord/witch minions (star 1) and veteran zombies.
aec_eo_tutorial_10_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 23: clear the elite mixed-minion trial. Kill headless/doomlord/witch minions (star 1) and veteran zombies.
aec_eo_tutorial_12_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO TUTORIAL | Chapter 024[-]
aec_eo_tutorial_12_offer,quests,Quest,,Craft 1 AEC Necroforge Workbench.
aec_eo_tutorial_12_desc,quests,Quest,,Chapter 24: craft the Necroforge Workbench to unlock ammo duplicator using mutation samples. Craft 1 AEC Necroforge Workbench.
