internationalMarket,blocks,Workstation,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Zombie Market Terminal
internationalMarketDesc,blocks,Workstation,,"The zombie market opens to you. You can request resources from the governments of countries still containing survivors across the globe. However, Dukes have no value, and shipping them would take far too long, so you must pay using local cryptocurrencies."
blackMarketAEC,blocks,Workstation,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Black Market
blackMarketAECDesc,blocks,Workstation,,"For ultimate modded weapons and items, coming soon"
