airdrop_blackMarket,entityclasses,Entity,,Airdrop
questItem_blackMarketDesc,items,item,New,"For ultimate modded weapons and items, coming soon"
CallDropUsed,blocks,QuestItems,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Call for Airdrop
CallDropModelDesc,blocks,QuestItems,,Allows you to mark your position to planes and helicopters for AEC airdrop.
quest_InternationalMarketDesc,items,Request,,Request an airdrop for the desired resource. The airdrop will be delivered to your position once the area has been cleared of zombies. You can request several airdrop at a time. [DECEA3]DO NOT START AN AIRDROP INSIDE PROTECTED BASE.[-]
questNameKey_AirdropRequest,Quest,Quest Info,,Airdrop Request from [DECEA3]Zombie Market Terminal[-]
questDescriptionKey_AirdropRequest,Quest,Quest Info,,"You requested an airdrop. Mark your position outdoor by placing the flag in your backpack outside, but watch out for zombies. We can only deliver the package once the area has been cleared."
questItem_CryptoMiner,items,Request,,Airdrop Request for [FFD700]AEC[-] [DECEA3]Crypto Miner[-]
cryptoMiner,blocks,Block,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Crypto Miner
cryptoMinerDesc,blocks,Block,,A mining station that passively generates [FFFF00]crypto coins[-] over time from [FFFF00]server battery[-]. Server batteries are buyable from an [FFFF00]zombie market terminal[-]. It can be upgraded with [FFFF00]superchargers and graphic cards[-].
airdrop_CryptoMiner,entityclasses,Entity,,[FFD700]AEC[-] Crypto Miner Airdrop
AEC_CoinDesc,items,item,New,Virtual currency created from batteries. Use it in the [FFFF00]zombie market terminal[-].
modelConnexionCardDesc,items,item,New,A connection card assembled from the associated boss and minion parts. Use it to mint the matching Coin from batteries.
Connexion_Card_Can_Be_Find_In_Lootchests/bags,items,item,,Connexion Cards can be found in loot chests
