aecEOProgressionBook001,items,Item Name,,[66B3FF]AEC EO PROGRESSION[-] 001/419 | 0★ Minions 01/39 | Druid Minions
aecEOProgressionBook001Desc,items,Item Desc,,Open to begin 0★ Minions operation 1 of the main AEC EO Progression campaign.
aec_eo_progression_001_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO PROGRESSION[-] 001/419 | 0★ Minions 01/39 | Druid Minions
aec_eo_progression_001_offer,quests,Quest,,Kill 5 Druid Minions.
aec_eo_progression_001_desc,quests,Quest,,Every campfire tale ends with this creature in the dark. Hunt it now; each confirmed kill buys the living one more night to prepare. Kill 5 Druid Minions.
aec_eo_progression_001_objective,quests,Objective,,Kill 5 Druid Minions
aecEOProgressionBook002,items,Item Name,,[66B3FF]AEC EO PROGRESSION[-] 002/419 | 0★ Minions 02/39 | Druid Research Paper
