aec_eo_progression_002_name,quests,Quest,,[66B3FF]AEC EO PROGRESSION[-] 002/419 | 0★ Minions 02/39 | Druid Research Paper
aec_eo_progression_002_offer,quests,Quest,,Craft 1 Druid Research Paper.
aec_eo_progression_002_desc,quests,Quest,,The libraries burned; our laboratory is a stained workbench. Turn field notes into a research paper and give this species a weakness we can remember. Craft 1 Druid Research Paper.
aecEOProgressionBook003,items,Item Name,,[66B3FF]AEC EO PROGRESSION[-] 003/419 | 0★ Minions 03/39 | Druid Part Miner
