aec_eo_progression_004_desc,quests,Quest,,"The old authorities issued badges. In the ruins, progress is measured in blood-marked AEC tokens. Present this one without surrendering it and unlock the next hunt. Possess 1 Universal Tokens T00 A2. Required Gamestage: 20."
