perkAecSilentPredatorRank1LongDesc,progression,perk Aec,,Each rank reduces noise generated by 2%.
perkAecNightStalkerName,progression,perk Aec,,Night Stalker
perkAecNightStalkerDesc,progression,perk Aec,,"Reduces the light you emit, making you harder to spot."
