perkAecGhostWalkerName,progression,perk Aec,,Ghost Walker
perkAecGhostWalkerDesc,progression,perk Aec,,Reduces how long enemies search for you after losing track.
perkAecGhostWalkerRank1Desc,progression,perk Aec,,Ghost Walker
perkAecGhostWalkerRank1LongDesc,progression,perk Aec,,Each rank reduces enemy search duration by 2%.
perkAecArmorBreakerName,progression,perk Aec,,Armor Breaker
perkAecArmorBreakerDesc,progression,perk Aec,,Melee attacks reduce the effective armor of your target.
perkAecArmorBreakerRank1Desc,progression,perk Aec,,Armor Breaker
perkAecArmorBreakerRank1LongDesc,progression,perk Aec,,Each rank reduces target armor by 2% for melee attacks.
